-- reg. 4: the service may be provided only where the fee prescribed has been
-- paid in full -- and where NO fee is prescribed, reg. 4 has nothing to
-- withhold, so nothing paid is enough. That is why a candidate sitting the
-- theoretical examination on a day under the text as made is admitted having
-- paid nothing, and refused on the very next vintage.

